Ya he terminado mi ERP personal. En las imágenes muestro el antes y el después. El próximo proyecto será RANKMAKER, cuyo código liberaré en cuanto lo termine, junto con su versión anterior.', 'I’m continuing with my goal of revamping all my websites to deploy them on Cloudflare instead of Hostinger with PHP.

I’ve already finished my personal ERP. In the images, I show the before and after. The next project will be RANKMAKER, and I’ll release the code as soon as I finish it, along with its previous version.', '["/imgs/posts/erp-antiguo.png","/imgs/posts/erp.png"]');
